# T0113 — Ownership — project tree scoping

**Task:** T0113 (id `125`) — Ownership — project tree scoping  
**Parent:** T0110 — Per-user record ownership (`pending`)  
**Grandparent:** T0095 — Implement Multi-User  
**State:** implementing on `T0113-ownership-project-tree`  
**Priority:** high  
**Depends on:** T0112 ✅ complete  
**Unblocks:** T0115 (with T0114)

## Context

T0112 shipped `ownerId` + helpers (`assertCanAccessOwned`, `ownerScope`, `OwnershipAccessError` → 403 `access_denied`). Create paths stamp ownership; **no list/get/mutate enforcement yet**. Nested project tables have **no** `ownerId` — access inherits from `projects.ownerId`.

## Interview (confirmed)

| # | Topic | Decision |
|---|-------|----------|
| 1 | Access source of truth | Gate via **`projects.ownerId`**. Nested resources inherit; do **not** re-check child `ownerId` when `projectId` is set. |
| 2 | Dual-scope entities (`tasks`, `todos`, `todo_lists`, `image_boards`) | **`projectId != null` → project owner (this Task).** `projectId == null` → leave to **T0114**. |
| 3 | Cross-tenant denial | **403** `access_denied` (existing helper), including nested routes after project resolve fails ownership. Keep **404** only when the project/resource truly does not exist. |
| 4 | Project list / reorder | Non-admins: list and reorder **only their** projects (`ownerScope`). Admins: all. |
| 5 | Activity / dependencies | Resolve task → if `projectId` set, assert project access; unsorted → T0114 (no change this Task beyond project-backed paths). |
| 6 | Transfer / UI | No SPA ownership UI. Admin transfer stays **T0115**. No schema migration. |

## Goal

Non-admins list/get/mutate only projects they own (and all nested content under those projects). Administrators retain full visibility and mutate. Authorship columns unchanged.

## Scope

### Shared helper

Add something like `assertCanAccessProject(db, actorUserId, projectId)` (load project → `assertCanAccessOwned` on `ownerId`; missing project → 404). Reuse from nested `requireProject` paths and flat dual-scope routes when `projectId` is set.

### Enforce on

| Area | Routes / notes |
|------|----------------|
| Projects hub | `projects.ts` — list `ownerScope`; get/patch/delete/reorder; nested mounts |
| Nested under `/:projectId` | `tasks`, `documents`, `boards` (+ columns/lanes/cards), `wiki`, `canvases`, `phases`, `groups`, `modules` |
| Dual-scope (project branch only) | `todos`, `todoLists`, `imageBoards`, `standaloneTasks` when `projectId` set or entity has `projectId` |
| Task activity / deps | Project-backed tasks only |

